  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "DesignDependent",
    "PRD-008",
    "PRD-009",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13731",
      "body": "User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d The PDP displays a set of tabs on the slide out, corresponding with the CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content. - can we add that Find my size needs to be one of the tabs, I think it is captured later in the ticket but as its not one of the CTA’s listed there I want to ensure that there is no confusion.\n\nIt should also be listed in this AC:\nThe slide-out supports the following tabs: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance (plus EU Environmental Qualities on EU/FR storefronts).",
